# Build context for the LTX video wrapper.
#
# Only ltx_wrapper.py is copied into the image; the 25 GB of weights under
# models/ are bind-mounted at run time. Without this file every build shipped
# them to BuildKit, which was most of the build time and a large part of the
# disk it consumed.
models/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.gguf
*.safetensors
*.onnx
*.log
